<title>USA: U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. soybean meal major sales activity in the week ended Aug 29 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:     1995/96		 1996/97</p>
<p> Australia     10,500		   Nil</p>
<p> Canada	   7,900</p>
<p>Weekly exports of 92,000 tonnes were three times larger than the previous week and 10 percent above the four-week average.</p>
<p>Primary destinations: Lithuania and Ukraine.</p>
</text>
